    "jsCode": "const c=document.getElementById(\"c\").getContext(\"2d\");let t=0;(function f(){c.clearRect(0,0,320,180);for(let k=0;k<4;k++){c.beginPath();for(let x=0;x<=320;x+=4)c.lineTo(x,90+Math.sin(x/28+t+k)*(20+k*8));c.strokeStyle=[\"#38bdf8\",\"#a78bfa\",\"#f472b6\",\"#facc15\"][k];c.lineWidth=2;c.stroke()}t+=.04;requestAnimationFrame(f)})()"
